  Dialogues:
  - 'Why is it so dark here? What happened? This place looks abandoned. Plants are
    starting to grow everywhere. '
  - "There\u2019s hardly any light. Maybe it\u2019s just because it\u2019s nighttime.
    I\u2019m also getting tired. "
  - 'I need to find someone who can help me find my way home. '
